  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 10.0.0.8-Beta-02 - 2026-11-19\n- updated Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities nuget version to resolve vulnerablility \n- added overrideQueueArn in PublishEventToQueue \n\n## 10.0.0.8-Beta-01 - 2026-11-17\n- Removed the Duplicate Code Issue onto the MySqlDbHelperRepository\n- Pinned Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities to 2.3.14 to address GHSA-6527-9fp8-r4x6\n\n## 10.0.0.7-Beta-01 - 2026-11-13\n- Updated the User Name Validation Regex\n\n## 10.0.0.6-Beta-01 - 2026-10-27\n\n## 10.0.0.6 - 2026-10-29\n- updated MySqlConnector nuget version to resolve vulnerablility\n\n## 10.0.0.5-Beta-01 - 2026-10-27\n- added dynamodb attributes to AuditLog\n\n## 10.0.0.3-Beta-01 - 2026-10-19\n- Upgrade package Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc,System.Security.Cryptography.Xml\n\n## 10.0.0.2-Beta-01 - 2026-10-15\n- Removed ISD code from Contact Model\n\n## 10.0.0.1-Beta-01 - 2026-08-10\n- Updated city field validation to support USPS-Compliant special characters\n\n## 10.0.0.0-Beta-02 - 2026-23-07\n- Upgrade to Dotnet 10 with efcore 9",
